  BudgetTrap keys:    ['_enriched', 'detail', 'kind', 'offending_op', 'offending_op_name', 'position_path', 'repair_hint', 'valid_alternatives']
  DeltaTrap keys:     ['_enriched', 'detail', 'kind', 'offending_op', 'offending_op_name', 'position_path', 'repair_hint', 'valid_alternatives']

  shared by all 3:    ['detail', 'kind', 'offending_op', 'offending_op_name', 'position_path', 'repair_hint', 'valid_alternatives']
  OK -- all L2 spec fields present in compile + runtime errors.
  AI handler can switch on `stage` (compile/runtime) and
